  "body": "## Summary\n\nAdd `research/p104-complementary-dual/`, a complementary native-frame realization of the complete corrected P104 logical inverse-transpose.\n\n```text\nPR2497 descending persistent frame paths\n  physical-label orthogonal complementation\n358 monotone persistent paths, unchanged local rank mass 3126\n```\n\nExact native checks cover 909 directed transport types, 1654 occurrences and 208 monomial intrinsic endpoint adapters, including global phase. The full 4982-event scalar word and eight exact private zero erasures are retained. This closes the finite persistent-frame/native-price part of the predecessor's complementary-frame handoff.\n\nThe physical operator is the stated logical inverse-transpose between new complementary charts. It is not physical F^-T, not a free conversion of the predecessor's physical arrays, and not a complete supplier.\n\nCard `p104-side-correction`, priority revision 4, with a documented pivot from the already-covered direct-ADD question to this finite frame interface. Scientific base is `0fdd7d82de03e43c9e5a1000dfbcd380d1b687d2`.\n\nCredit ywz65 / #2497 at `7f2cf129d42030d3eb3975b7d1b07392c6d32a1b` for the complete word and zero-restoring collectors, #2458 at `3170afd2fc13a990bfe28f5ab6421bcda4ffd0f6` for native forward binding, Ross Richardson / #2445 for two-target correction, and the retained compiler/interpreter/P104 lineage. The complete source word is retained byte-for-byte and all source-specific notices remain intact.\n\n[Tested artifact](https://github.com/petalas/integer-mult-bounds/tree/8af7c324714866afa199e4b7bf80a8f82e56d6f3/research/p104-complementary-dual)\n\n## Evidence\n\n- **Before:** the pinned backward word has descending persistent paths and explicitly leaves a complementary monotone realization open.\n  **After:** all 358 persistent paths are monotone in the physical-label complements. Exact phase/rank checks, all 128164 arbitrary-input boundary coefficients and eight private erasures pass at the unchanged profile.\n- The registered replay passes six semantic controls and eight tests. A separate dense-dyadic/nullspace implementation covers all 7352 literal frame occurrences. Complete decompressed recipe regeneration, equivalent bases, source-before-import rejection, required evidence, exclusive output and optimized Git-free read-only replay are checked.\n\n```sh\npython3.12 -Werror -B scripts/research_package.py \\\n  --package research/p104-complementary-dual\n```\n\nChecked with CPython 3.12.15 on Linux x86_64 / WSL2. The private rank8-to-rank1-to-rank8 paths are not monotone. Physical private storage, scalar/address routing, rounded precision/erasure, global hosting/idle/residual costs, remaining 102 corrections and all-size/caller admission remain open. No full selected cold replay or new kappa is claimed.\n\n## Merge Danger\n\n**Door:** two-way\n\n**Blast Radius:** research\n\nOnly this opt-in package is added. Selected records and frozen predecessors are unchanged. The logical-versus-physical operator distinction and private-storage limits must remain explicit when using the result.\n",
